<p><strong>Evidence query (example, verify before use):</strong></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[SELECT name, CAST(value_in_use AS int) AS value_in_use
  FROM sys.configurations
 WHERE name IN ('xp_cmdshell', 'clr enabled', 'Ole Automation Procedures');]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p><strong>Remediation (example, apply through change management):</strong></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[EXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 1; RECONFIGURE;
EXEC sp_configure 'xp_cmdshell', 0; RECONFIGURE;
EXEC sp_configure 'show advanced options', 0; RECONFIGURE;]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
